Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.58,0:00:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：诅咒者之战》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.00,0:00:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,《罗马公敌》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.40,0:00:49.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,报告军情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give report!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:52.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的骑兵冲破了我军西翼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus' cavalry has broken our western flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.26,0:00:53.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死的野蛮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That fucking savage.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.95,0:00:57.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,传令下去  向南边集结列阵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give signal to re-form to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.85,0:01:57.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.06,0:03:13.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们得赶紧撤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.99,0:03:51.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.57,0:03:54.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗马军队鸣金退兵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Romans have sounded retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:03.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们打赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have won the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.40,0:04:05.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们啥也没赢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have won nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:09.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯又从我们手心里溜了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossinius and Furius again slip from grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.80,0:04:12.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过他们那么多走狗没能溜掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The same cannot be said for many that stood with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.31,0:04:15.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,漫山遍野都是尸体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The field is thick with the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.03,0:04:21.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,活该如此  这些家伙还妄想再次奴役我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Deserved fate for all who would see us again to shackle and whip.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.75,0:04:36.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,又战败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Another standard lost?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.18,0:04:41.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,真是大伤共和国的元气  科西尼斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a grave wound inflicted upon the Republic, Cossinius.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.46,0:04:42.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们没有及时撤出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A deeper one would have been suffered,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.85,0:04:44.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,损失就更惨重了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}had we not withdrawn from battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:47.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈的没道理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It confounds the fucking senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.01,0:04:50.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,这帮乌合之众怎么一而再地挫败我们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How could a handful of errant slaves continue to vex us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.85,0:04:54.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕元老院严重低估了他们的兵力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear their numbers have been sorely underestimated within the Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.24,0:04:55.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的人马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus' mongrel horde
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:57.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,自从在维苏威击败葛雷博后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}has swelled with each passing victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.70,0:05:00.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,每次获胜都有壮大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}since Glaber's defeat at Vesuvius.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.80,0:05:07.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们攻占卢卡尼亚矿区后  增加了数千人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They added thousands to rank liberating the mines of Lucania.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.99,0:05:17.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,全国各地的奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Slaves across the Republic,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.86,0:05:19.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,多年安守本分  侍奉主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}humble and grateful to their masters
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.45,0:05:21.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,如今见斯巴达克斯风生水起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for so many years, have broken to treachery
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.39,0:05:24.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,竟然也纷纷变节倒戈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the wake of ever expanding legend of Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:28.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯寇法在凯洛河岸战败后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Untold numbers joined his cause
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.81,0:05:31.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,不知道有多少人投奔了叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after Scrofa fell to him on the banks of the Calor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.76,0:05:47.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的鹰旗和束棒落入叛军之手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His standards and fasces falling to the enemy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:49.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,其人也未能脱身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the man himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.00,0:05:54.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,区区一个该死的奴隶竟然能翻江倒海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such chaos and death at the hands of a fucking slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.65,0:05:56.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果再不派出援军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will discover this fucking slave
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.03,0:05:57.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就会发现这个该死的奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}at the very gates of Rome itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.97,0:05:59.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,要一路杀到罗马城下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if reinforcements are not dispatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.38,0:06:04.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,卢库勒斯在黑海附近与米特拉达梯人作战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucullus battles Mithridates near the Black Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.47,0:06:07.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,安东尼乌斯出海进剿克里特岛的海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Antonius sails against the pirates plaguing Crete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.80,0:06:11.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,庞培还在跟西班牙的塞多留叛军苦战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pompey yet struggles with the renegade Sertorius in Espainia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.76,0:06:15.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,如此乱局  元老院已经力不从心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The resources of the Senate are drained by these conflicts.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:18.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们既没有兵力  也没有支付军饷的财力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have not the men nor the coin to procure them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.91,0:06:26.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,有一个人可以自掏腰包支援前线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is one among us who could fund endeavor from his own purse.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:29.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,对他来说不过九牛一毛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And never feel sting of its cost.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.52,0:06:32.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,我并不希望那人搅和进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had hoped to avoid involving the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.28,0:06:36.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不愿意欠他的人情  梅泰勒斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We would not be beholden to him any more than you, Metellus.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.97,0:06:39.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是还有出路  我们绝对不找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Produce alternative, and we shall seize upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.95,0:06:45.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.72,0:06:49.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我这就回罗马请求克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall return to Rome and entreat Crassus
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.20,0:06:52.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,协助我们剿灭斯巴达克斯叛军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to aid in crushing Spartacus and his rebellion.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.20,0:06:56.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,与此同时  抚平我们的伤痛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in the act, attempt to redress grievous injury
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:58.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,重拾共和国的光荣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}inflicted upon the honor of the Republic.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.77,0:07:18.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,战场上丢弃的武器和马匹都到手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The field has been stripped of weapons and horses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.20,0:07:20.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗马军队的损失又充实了我们的力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Romans' loss again becomes our bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.67,0:07:21.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What of Gannicus?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.45,0:07:24.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想听听他的报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have his report as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.23,0:07:25.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也知道他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You well know the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:27.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,打了胜仗就去找乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He favors celebration after a victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:29.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,经常是几天几夜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Often for many days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.63,0:07:31.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,等灭了科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing I would gladly give blessing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.31,0:07:34.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是非常支持他找乐子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}after Cossinius and Furius fall from concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.07,0:07:36.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来他们不是傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have proven themselves no fools.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.36,0:07:38.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是有可能采取大胆行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And may yet attempt bold maneuver.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.96,0:07:40.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,在附近山岭上加派巡逻队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Double our sentries in surrounding hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,不能被他们打个措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not be caught unaware.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.41,0:07:44.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也太高估那些混蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You give those shits credit beyond due.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.56,0:07:46.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人才会轻视对手  艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Underestimating your opponent is a Roman trait, Agron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.78,0:07:48.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,你可别受影响了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not fall prey to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.78,0:07:52.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯气数已尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossinius and Furius come to the end of their days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.17,0:07:55.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,每天都有几百个奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With each passing sun, hundreds of slaves
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.86,0:07:57.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,投身于我们的大业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}break bond to join our cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:07:59.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron is not wrong in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.45,0:08:03.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,很快我们就有人数优势了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon we shall have the advantage of numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.71,0:08:10.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,验验他们的本事  武装起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gauge prowess of all that have joined us, and see them readied.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.05,0:08:13.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要尽快找机会出击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would strike again at nearest opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.82,0:08:16.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗马的那帮蠢货妄想一脚踩死我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and give further warning to the fools in Rome
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.66,0:08:19.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,就让他们尝尝厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}seeking to grind us beneath heel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.91,0:08:53.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,几个月了  他每天都跟那人缠斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Every day for months he wrestles with the man,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,哼哼哈嘿不绝于耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}groans and grunts filling ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.53,0:08:57.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,您父亲学得很用心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your father is a dedicated student.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.90,0:09:00.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,还非要我站在一边瞧着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I forced to stand witness to the lessons,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.07,0:09:04.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,更要紧的大事都没人顾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}while more pressing matters fall to ill attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.74,0:09:17.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,对不起  主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, Dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.14,0:09:19.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我打得兴起  没有留神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I lose myself in the heat of contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:27.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,划伤而已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Less than a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.50,0:09:31.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,刚才毫无防备  这伤算是太轻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Worse deserved for not anticipating blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.25,0:09:34.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,您学得很快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are quick of study.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:38.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,但当您借势猛攻时  侧面便空门大开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you open flank to injury when perceived advantage is pressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.51,0:09:42.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,元老院的很多人都是这么完蛋的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ruin of many a man within the Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.68,0:09:46.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,等吃过晚饭再来练习吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us return to lesson after evening meal is broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:47.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,告退  主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.84,0:09:52.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来传言是真的  克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rumors prove true, Crassus.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.71,0:09:55.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然接受奴隶的教导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You take instruction from a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.71,0:09:59.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,海拉努斯在竞技场稳坐冠军宝座多年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hilarus stood a champion of the arena for many years.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.60,0:10:02.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,我为他花的钱之多  你这辈子都没见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I paid his lanista more coin than you'll ever see in your life
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.28,0:10:03.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,不只是买他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to purchase the man,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.12,0:10:06.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有他的角斗经验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and impart what he's learned of the games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:10.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,了解那些血溅沙场的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And of the men who have drawn blood upon the sands.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.39,0:10:11.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gladiators.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:13.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,这正是我来的目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You strike upon very subject of my visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.24,0:10:17.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们能不能私下谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we may break word in private?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.38,0:10:21.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我向来以成年人的要求培养提比略\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, Tiberius is well trained in the ways of men.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.20,0:10:24.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,也希望他多接触元老院的事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would expose him to those of the Senate as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.38,0:10:30.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,是这样  我们在镇压斯巴达克斯叛军时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To the matter, we've have suffered unexpected complications
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.51,0:10:32.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,遇到了意料之外的复杂情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in our conflict with the rebel Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:36.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯完蛋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossinius and Furius have fallen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:40.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们逃过一死  但急需援军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They live, but find themselves inneed of reinforcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.87,0:10:44.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,正当多事之秋  这要求实在很难满足\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An expensive thing to acquire, in these troubled times.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.74,0:10:51.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定被斯巴达克斯干到菊花都残了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their asses must be sore from the ramming Spartacus has given,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.19,0:10:53.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,不惜来求我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to come begging to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.07,0:10:54.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是求你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No one is begging.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:58.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们是在向元老院的成员要求援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are asking assistance from a loyal member of the Senate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.49,0:11:01.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,援助多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How much assistance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:02.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,一万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ten thousand men.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.22,0:11:10.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,要养这么庞大的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would take considerable coin and effort
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.24,0:11:11.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,财力精力可不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to raise such a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.12,0:11:14.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,作为回报  你可以有指挥权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in return you will be offered a command.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:17.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,位次当然在科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Under Cossinius and Furius, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.57,0:11:22.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,这话最好由他们亲口说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An offer better received from the men themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.98,0:11:25.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们撤到了努凯里亚郊区的一座宅子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They've withdrawn to a villa on the outskirts of Nuceria,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:28.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,在他们军团北边不远的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}within short ride of what remains of their legion to the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:32.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯仍在坎帕尼亚山区积聚力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus continues to gather force in the valley of Campania.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.58,0:11:36.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道  不到万不得已  我是不会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know I would not have come if situation did not demand of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:39.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,没错  我很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. You would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.92,0:11:46.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我同意他们的条件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their terms are agreeable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.46,0:11:51.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,我立刻把消息传达给他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will dispatch message to them immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:54.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是我派人去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Best I send my own men,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.35,0:11:57.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,确保这条消息送到该送的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to ensure it arrives at intended destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.34,0:11:59.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,悉听尊便\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Whatever your will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,说实话  我原以为你最起码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To voice truth of it, I had expected you to extort
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.67,0:12:06.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,要借机索要虚名高位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}inflated title at the very least,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.83,0:12:09.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像庞培领军讨伐塞多留时一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Pompey did to take his charge against Sertorius.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.21,0:12:16.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只关心挣来的名位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My interest lies only in title and honor earned.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.96,0:12:19.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉  是我小人之见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies for ever suspecting any less.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:28.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,您居然同意屈居科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would agree to serve beneath Cossinius and Furius,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.01,0:12:29.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,手无实权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent true command?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.89,0:12:30.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,看来是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It would appear so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.91,0:12:32.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以前听您痛骂那两人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have heard how you berate their names,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.08,0:12:36.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,认为他们和梅泰勒斯元老根本是愚蠢无能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}how foolish and vain you think them and Senator Metellus.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.31,0:12:38.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 父亲  - 现在不是说人闲话的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Father... - The time for words has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:40.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯必须死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus must fall,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.29,0:12:45.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,而我要选择正确的道路  尽快实现这一目的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I shall set upon what path I must to see day hastened.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.35,0:12:48.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了罗马的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the glory of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.22,0:13:14.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,当时可亮瞎了我的狗眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I saw it with my own fucking eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.88,0:13:17.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,战到酣处  鲜血和脑浆堆到膝盖这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the heat of battle, blood and brains thick to the knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:20.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,而甘尼克斯  就挺立其中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Gannicus, in the middle of it all!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:23.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,掏出他的巨鸟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Strips to his fucking cock,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.08,0:13:25.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,朝罗马人狂吼  要他们跪在面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}bellowing to the Romans to kneel before him
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.67,0:13:28.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,接受他的琼浆玉液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and receive golden tribute!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.06,0:13:33.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要解释  我那天酒喝了太多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In my defense, I had taken much wine that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.03,0:13:35.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,没想到斯巴达克斯转而进攻斯寇法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}not expecting Spartacus to turn and attack Scrofa.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.40,0:13:39.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有酒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is more wine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.68,0:13:44.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的朋友都饥渴难耐了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My friends, are of thirst.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:50.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,你女人带礼物来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your woman brings gifts!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.90,0:13:52.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,礼物  是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gifts, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:55.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,但不是给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.15,0:14:02.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.01,0:14:03.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:06.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的帐篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is my fucking tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.38,0:14:07.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.17,0:14:10.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们再找个帐篷  但愿也有一屋子妞儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall find another. Hopefully as well stocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.82,0:14:31.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯要见你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus need to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:33.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就先让他等等吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then let him see me a while longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.90,0:15:30.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,是错觉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it imagining,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.29,0:15:33.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,还是因为打了仗我们就爽翻天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or do we rise to heights unknown in wake of battle?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.61,0:15:36.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁不是呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As all men do,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:38.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,打赢了杀爽了兴致就高了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when bathed in blood and victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.96,0:15:45.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,那要是罗马灭亡  我们非爽到天崩地裂不可\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When Rome falls, I fear we shall split the heavens in celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.18,0:15:50.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,等朱庇特掉下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And fuck Jupiter
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.67,0:15:54.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,老子不操翻他才怪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as he plummets to the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.29,0:15:57.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么  你自以为像神一样威猛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, you believe you fuck as a God now?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.69,0:16:00.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可不是说大话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I boast but upon evidence given.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.16,0:16:02.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,豪言壮语加美酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Couple proud words with wine,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.52,0:16:04.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,再好好兑现你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see them better received.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.96,0:16:09.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,你今天在战场表现很不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You afforded yourself well upon the field this day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.34,0:16:10.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,你很惊讶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.56,0:16:15.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一直都相信你  纳西尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have always believed in you, Nasir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.67,0:16:20.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,即便在你还是叛逆的叙利亚小男奴的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even when you were yet a contrary little Syrian slave boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.29,0:16:22.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的双眼被蒙蔽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My eyes were yet shrouded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:25.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,是斯巴达克斯让我睁眼  我永远欠他一份情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am forever in Spartacus' debt, for parting veil.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.09,0:16:30.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们所有人都欠他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A debt shared equally by all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.45,0:16:34.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要用罗马人的命来偿还\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One we shall repay with Roman lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.85,0:16:41.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,你召见我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You summoned me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.39,0:16:44.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,本来没有必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have had to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.58,0:16:48.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,可你没跟克雷斯还有艾力冈一起来汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you had reported in with Crixus and Agron days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.31,0:16:52.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,我当时有更要紧的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My attentions were called by pressing matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.73,0:16:55.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,女人和美酒吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of women and drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.64,0:16:57.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,还能有别的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Are there any more so?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.37,0:17:03.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不来汇报  这事情就不算完\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Days can not pass after battle without your report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:07.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们打了仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We fought.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.33,0:17:08.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,打赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We won.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.23,0:17:10.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我这么说够了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Does that cover needed ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:17.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,你对付罗马军队的本事我们都看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have proven valuable asset against the Romans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.47,0:17:22.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我希望你不光是一介武夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet I would have you stand more than just another sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.99,0:17:27.51,*Default,,0,0,0,,还要站到克雷斯和我身边  成为领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take rightful place beside Crixus and myself, as a leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.51,0:17:30.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,为了奥诺玛默斯  我甘愿为你而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will give life to your cause, in honor of Oenomaus.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.46,0:17:33.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,我甚至相信有一天真的会为你而死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I may even believe in it myself upon a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.07,0:17:35.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,但我不是领袖  也不想当领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But I am no leader, nor seek to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.86,0:17:37.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,但很多人已经视你为领袖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are many that already look to you as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.02,0:17:41.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,无数人会追随你去战斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A greater number still would follow you in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:44.03,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是说为我而死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You mean die for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.04,0:17:45.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,为我们的大业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.23,0:17:48.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想在弟兄们面前高高在上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not be set above my brothers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.06,0:17:50.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,以为我多么厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and thought greater than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.37,0:17:52.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,很多人都是这样看待你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As many begin to think of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.90,0:17:54.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,我并不希望这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not wish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.48,0:17:55.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,但却是事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it is so.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.33,0:17:58.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们把你当成神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They begin to speak of you as a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.92,0:18:01.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是你拿自己当凡人  估计他们不乐意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And may react poorly when you prove yourself mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.71,0:18:04.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只关心如何打败罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Victory against the Romans is my only concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.90,0:18:06.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎样才算打败他们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how is it defined?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.46,0:18:10.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,杀了科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯之后吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When Cossinius and Furius struck from this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.87,0:18:12.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,你知道那远远没有结束\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You know that will not be the end of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.58,0:18:15.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗马肯定紧接着派出更多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rome will send more and more in their wake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.85,0:18:17.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,来者必死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then they too shall fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:24.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,等我们推翻了强大的共和国之后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when we have laid waste to the mighty Republic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.16,0:18:27.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你又要向何处宣泄怒火呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What will you turn your wrath upon then hmmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.84,0:18:32.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,逼你走上这条路的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The men that set you on this path,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.24,0:18:36.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,夺走你妻子的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the men that took your wife from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.93,0:18:39.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,连同他们的妻子都已经不在世上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are gone from this world. Their wives too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.82,0:18:43.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,露迪雅和伊莉西娅的死讯都传来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In past news of Lucretia and Ilithyia's fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.73,0:18:48.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,多少人命都无法偿还苏拉的血债\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thousand lives would not equal Sura's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:55.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也爱过一个女人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I dared to love a woman once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.33,0:18:57.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我还是巴蒂塔斯的奴隶时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When I was a slave to Batiatus.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:18:59.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,她还在世吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She yet draws breath?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.13,0:19:05.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要她能活过来  我愿放弃一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would give the world to have it so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.74,0:19:09.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们这样的人  都是同病相怜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fate too common, for men such as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:11.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,我已经为她报了仇  就像你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had my vengeance, as you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.95,0:19:13.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,却不能弥补心中的失落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And stood as empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.39,0:19:19.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,直到奥诺玛默斯原谅了我的背叛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until Oenomaus forgave betrayal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:20.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.93,0:19:25.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我爱上的人是他的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was his wife I lost heart to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.97,0:19:30.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,虽然我已获得了自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even when freedom was gained,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:35.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我心中的枷锁却无法解开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shackles of what I had done to those I loved remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:41.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯临死前帮我解开了这枷锁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}With final breath, Oenomaus struck chains that bound me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:48.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,我却早已没有贴心的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no one I hold to heart left
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,倾吐安慰的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to break such balming words.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.85,0:19:55.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,既然没有  就只能说给自己听了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent such, a man must speak them to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.60,0:19:59.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,说了也没有用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Words also denied me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.79,0:20:03.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,所以你在千军万马  浴血奋战中寻求慰藉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You seek them in the voice of thousands, clamoring for blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.07,0:20:04.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我救不回我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I could not save my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.20,0:20:07.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要战斗到有那么一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I can fight to see a day
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.19,0:20:10.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有无辜的生命受到漠视\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when no innocent life is so easily disregarded.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.22,0:20:15.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗马及其残酷的统治成为遥远的历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A day when the Romans and their cruelty are but distant memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.12,0:20:20.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,但愿那一天  你能找到安宁  兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May you find peace in its arrival, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.48,0:20:32.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我们尽情享受女人和美酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us share wine and women,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:35.71,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要再讨论这种沉重的话题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and set aside such heavy fucking thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.71,0:20:37.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的心意我领了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The offer is much appreciated.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.04,0:20:44.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我便以你的名义饮酒作乐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I will drink and fuck in your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.67,0:20:46.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你振臂一呼  我浴血奋战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fight when called upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.07,0:20:49.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,在你这疯子的指引下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very steps to the Roman Senate
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:52.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,一直杀到罗马元老院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if that is where your madness leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.32,0:21:06.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,加价到三百五十第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise offer to 350 Denarii
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.28,0:21:09.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,外加两尤格（约两英亩）土地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and two iugera of land.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.57,0:21:11.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须尽快招募足够的兵力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must elevate numbers quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:14.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我交给萨比努斯去办  确保完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will dispatch Sabinus and see it done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.56,0:21:19.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你已经上床睡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.35,0:21:23.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,提比略总跟他讲打仗的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tiberius has filled his ears with talk of war.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:27.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,他脑袋里只有打仗  哪儿睡得着觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The battle rages in his head, vanquishing slumber.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.22,0:21:28.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it true?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.07,0:21:30.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,您要带兵去打斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ride with an army against Spartacus?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:32.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,当然  为了保卫共和国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes to defend the Republic,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.07,0:21:34.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,捍卫罗马  匹夫有责\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as is the duty of all Romans.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.79,0:21:37.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也是罗马人  我跟您去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm a Roman. I will go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.50,0:21:40.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,等你长大成人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, would that you were of an age,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.20,0:21:42.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,就能和父亲并肩作战了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to stand by your father's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.79,0:21:45.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,现在该睡觉了  普布利乌斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now for your bed, Publius,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.38,0:21:47.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,去梦见你将来的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and dream of future laurels.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.06,0:21:48.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,是  父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:55.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要你一声令下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would follow you to the shores
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.36,0:21:57.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是刀山火海都愿追随你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of the afterlife, if so commanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.51,0:22:01.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,提比略也一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As would Tiberius.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.87,0:22:04.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的军队出征时  他自然有一席之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will hold place amongst my troops when they march.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.49,0:22:05.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,一席之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A place?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.25,0:22:09.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,身居高位才对  要配得上他的名头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He deserves position of note, worthy of the name he bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.26,0:22:12.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,要做护民官  他的资历还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He does not yet hold the years for the title of Tribune.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.19,0:22:14.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,花点钱  再游说游说  就不用管这些规定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Coin and persuasion would see such rules set aside--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:16.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,他还不够格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has not earned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.02,0:22:23.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,提比略有冲锋陷阵的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tiberius has shown great promise as a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.33,0:22:26.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他缺乏谋略和洞察力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet he falls from target in strategy and discerning mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.58,0:22:28.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就好好指点他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then lend instruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.72,0:22:30.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在教导他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My lessons never cease.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.07,0:22:32.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,但修行靠个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is for him to apply them.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.10,0:22:35.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,公务要处理到深夜吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your work carries into night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.70,0:22:37.33,*Default,,0,0,0,,要通宵达旦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And threatens break of dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.12,0:22:41.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,我命人给你准备食物和酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall see food and wine brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.08,0:22:42.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,克芮会满足我的需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kore shall tend to my needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.49,0:22:48.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.63,0:22:51.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在床上等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your bed awaits.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.67,0:22:54.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,需要的话就过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you find want of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.05,0:23:04.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,凭他的荣誉早该手握实权了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is an honor long deserved, to be given command.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.13,0:23:06.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,结果还是屈居科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One he finds beneath Cossinius and Furius.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.69,0:23:08.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还从没见过你父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have never known your father
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.01,0:23:09.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,愿意屈居在别人的手下呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to remain beneath anyone for length of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.83,0:23:12.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许是年岁大了  他对荣誉和人民的拥戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, perhaps the years have tempered desire for laurels
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.57,0:23:14.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,没那么强烈渴望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and adulation of the crowds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.35,0:23:15.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的渴望呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what of your desires?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.57,0:23:18.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,足以把阿波罗烧死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apollo himself would be set ablaze by them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.92,0:23:20.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我可记着别太靠近你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall remember not to stand too near,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,怕翅膀融化了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for fear of melted wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.56,0:23:22.05,*Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.37,0:23:26.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,我要你跟我在一起  萨比努斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have you from my side in this, Sabinus.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.41,0:23:29.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,诸神也无法把我拉开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods themselves could not wrest me from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.18,0:23:33.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我负责提高价码  招兵买马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see offer raised and numbers elevated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.97,0:23:35.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.90,0:23:44.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我想起了你和萨比努斯小时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I recall a time when you and Sabinus were but children,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.86,0:23:46.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,用木棍打仗玩的情形\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}playing at war with wooden sticks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.80,0:23:48.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,那是以前玩的游戏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such games are of the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.57,0:23:51.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,对你父亲而言足以说明问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing yet proven to your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.60,0:23:56.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,别让他有理由继续质疑你的能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not give him cause to further doubt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:59.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,当我上战场屠杀敌人时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Any shall be swept from thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.78,0:24:03.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切怀疑都会烟消云散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when I stand awash in the blood of our enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.61,0:24:07.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,注意左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watch your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.22,0:24:09.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,当心中招\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Watch for the swing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.49,0:24:12.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的注意防守啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Raise fucking guard!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.07,0:24:14.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,这小子一天比一天厉害了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your boy grows fiercer by the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.37,0:24:16.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,很快我就不敢叫他小家伙了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Soon even I shall fear to call him little man.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.79,0:24:18.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,你现在要是跪地求饶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least now I will be able to understand you
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.69,0:24:20.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我完全能理解  傻逼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}when you yield, you simple shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.88,0:24:27.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartucus.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.47,0:24:29.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,下一个  准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Next man! Take position!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.07,0:24:32.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,快开始  快开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's go! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.42,0:24:34.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 开始  - 上啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Begin! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.01,0:24:40.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在掂量新来的人能耐如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We test the last of those that have joined us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.34,0:24:41.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do you find them?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.87,0:24:43.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,很有激情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enthusiastic.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.73,0:24:46.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,不过技术太糙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet short of skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.01,0:24:48.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们当中很多人以前也是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Many among us once stood as such.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.75,0:24:51.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们很快就能证明自己的价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These will soon prove as worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.37,0:24:52.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕有人不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.43,0:25:03.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,下一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Next man!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.06,0:25:12.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,不要多话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not speak of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.68,0:25:14.63,*Default,,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.95,0:25:17.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,你是迪欧特莫斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Diotimos?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.08,0:25:20.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,是又怎样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If I were?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.46,0:25:23.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.83,0:25:24.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.58,0:25:35.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,我只能分这么多了  少他妈的问这问那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I can spare no more than this, so do not fucking ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.56,0:25:37.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢  谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude, gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.77,0:25:39.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,你宰了一匹马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have killed a horse?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.42,0:25:41.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的小点声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lower fucking voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.53,0:25:44.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,让人知道这里有肉的话  我就搞不到畜生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not follow the animal in crush news of meat would bring.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.66,0:25:47.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,谁允许你这么做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who gave permission?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.22,0:25:50.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,战场上骑兵的价值可是步兵的十倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man atop a horse in battle is valued ten upon foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.35,0:25:52.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,它在与罗马人的交战中受了很重的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He was gravely wounded against the Romans.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.66,0:25:55.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是想找山上那位大人批准一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have sought permission from the great man upon the hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.47,0:25:59.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,但斯巴达克斯国王正忙着四处征战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but King Spartacus is far too busy waging war
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.77,0:26:01.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,哪有闲心管这种鸡毛蒜皮的破事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to bother with such low concerns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.94,0:26:03.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,你怎会有这样的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What moves you to such thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.87,0:26:07.30,*Default,,0,0,0,,睁开狗眼一看你不就知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Open fucking eyes you have your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.69,0:26:10.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,我有点后悔当初离开温柔的海风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I begin to question turning from the calm of the ocean breeze
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.60,0:26:13.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,城墙的庇护了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and the safety of my city's walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.58,0:26:15.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,这么说你以前是自由人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were a free man, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.41,0:26:16.66,*Default,,0,0,0,,早就不是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Far removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.11,0:26:20.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在希留爱沙山为一个混账东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I toiled beneath the heel of a most unpleasant shit
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.06,0:26:21.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,累死累活地工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in Sinuessa en Valle.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.35,0:26:24.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他娘的最起码能管吃管穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet he at least provided for fucking needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.86,0:26:27.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,你认为自由是毫无代价的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you expect freedom to come absent cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.19,0:26:28.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.38,0:26:33.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,但他妈的既然不管吃不管穿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet absent fucking plan to be clothed or fed
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.12,0:26:35.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能自力更生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}we must take matters into our own hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.45,0:26:38.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,要是等那位携雨之使者携他娘的大雨来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or risk early grave waiting for the Bringer of Fucking Rain
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.50,0:26:41.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们怕是早饿死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to bless us with much needed shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.79,0:26:53.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,这天很快便转冷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Weather will soon turn cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.81,0:26:55.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们就...  - 斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- And with it... - Spartacus!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.65,0:26:57.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,一群罗马兵从北面过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A clutch of Romans ride from the north,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.42,0:26:59.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,打算通过我们控制的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}attempting to slip past our position.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.16,0:27:01.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,你就是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are Spartacus?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.57,0:27:04.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 万分抱歉  我不...  - 不用说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Apologies, I did... - Still tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.07,0:27:07.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也许不能每天都吃饱穿暖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You may not always have full belly or warm cloak,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.07,0:27:11.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,但只要我还活着  你说什么都是自由的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but while I draw breath you have freedom to speak your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.57,0:27:14.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,即便是说山上那位大人的坏话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even against the great man upon the hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.83,0:27:21.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的妈呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.15,0:27:57.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You there!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.06,0:28:00.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,你离叛军营地这么近  有何企图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is your purpose so near rebel encampment?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.00,0:28:12.58,*Default,,0,0,0,,同你一道的还有谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who else is with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.16,0:28:16.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,回答我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Find fucking tongue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.81,0:28:19.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,有谁和你一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.24,0:28:23.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Death.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.05,0:29:20.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要追上他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.93,0:29:22.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,不用  矛给我  快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. A spear. Quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.00,0:29:34.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,我的剑术与你不相上下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I stand your equal with sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.84,0:29:37.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,可你他妈的掷得一手好矛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you have me by fucking spear.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.08,0:29:38.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.34,0:29:41.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,这个人身上有信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This one carried a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.08,0:29:49.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,上面怎么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.03,0:29:53.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,一万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ten thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.59,0:29:56.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,由马科斯·克拉苏亲自率领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Led by Marcus Crassus Himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.63,0:29:58.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯将获得强援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossinius and Furius will see their numbers swell,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.86,0:30:00.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,占据绝对优势\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}stripping advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.89,0:30:03.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以设下埋伏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We could lay trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.47,0:30:05.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,这里  亚壁古道的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Here, upon the Appian Way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.21,0:30:07.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,在他们跟弟兄会师之前  杀他们个措手不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Catch them by surprise before they have chance to join their brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.89,0:30:10.31,*Default,,0,0,0,,这样一来我们就会陷入北面进军的克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That would place us between Crassus advancing from the north
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.31,0:30:12.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,与南面科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯的包夹当中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and Cossinius and Furius in the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.29,0:30:15.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人可应付不了腹背受敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do not have the men to face armies on both fronts.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.85,0:30:17.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,天平偏向他们之前  我们必须\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must strike Cossinius and Furius
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.37,0:30:19.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,主动攻击科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}before odds tip to imbalance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.22,0:30:21.22,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们打得他们叫苦不迭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have inflicted nagging wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.25,0:30:24.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,可几个月来都没能浇灭他们的士气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet for months we have failed to shatter resolve of their men.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.60,0:30:26.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,用他们将军的脑袋开路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps the heads of their commanders
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.01,0:30:28.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,也许就能动摇他们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}carried before us would so sway them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.30,0:30:31.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,取上将之首可不是探囊取物啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Trophies proven difficult to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.27,0:30:34.43,*Default,,0,0,0,,于百万军中  的确如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}On the field of battle, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.89,0:30:39.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,但据纸上所写  这信并非要送进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By what is written here, message was not directed
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.46,0:30:41.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,大军之中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to where their troops lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.65,0:30:46.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,这上面说  望此消息能安全抵达宅邸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It speaks of hope that word finds them safe within the villa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.10,0:30:48.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们躲起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They have gone to ground?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.46,0:30:50.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,有热水澡  还有女人的身子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Warm bath and the comfort of women,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.64,0:30:52.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我到罗马可没白去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if my days in Rome are of worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.66,0:30:54.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,这宅子在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is this villa?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.99,0:30:56.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,并未写明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It does not say.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.43,0:30:58.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,那还不是毫无进展\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we return to beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.74,0:31:02.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们在此截杀的克拉苏信使正往东南方向去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We intercepted Crassus' men here, riding southeast.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.20,0:31:03.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯肯定不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossinius and Furius would seek to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.78,0:31:06.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,与大军相隔过远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}within reasonable distance of their men.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.98,0:31:09.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们的宅子肯定在这个地区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would place their villa somewhere within this region.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.59,0:31:11.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,怎么找出来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How do we divine which is theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.07,0:31:13.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,如你所说  他们不是傻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They are no fools, as you have said.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.83,0:31:16.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,只要观察哨岗的分布就能看出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will know location by placement of sentries.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.55,0:31:18.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们肯定也会在宅子附近\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And sizable force they no doubt have
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.85,0:31:20.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,部署相当的兵力加以保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}without villa to lend protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.22,0:31:24.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就倾巢而出  发动奇袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then we descend upon them with every sword we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.34,0:31:25.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.34,0:31:28.89,*Default,,0,0,0,,大军进攻宅子很容易打草惊蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We risk discovery moving against the villa with large numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.89,0:31:30.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯受了惊吓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossinius and Furius would be alerted,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.84,0:31:32.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,便有可能再次从我们手中溜走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and have chance to slip again from grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.75,0:31:38.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,少数几个人却可以神不知鬼不觉地渗透进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet a few men might penetrate defense unnoticed...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.61,0:31:40.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,以少敌多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few against many.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.42,0:31:42.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,历历往事啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Much as the old days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.54,0:31:45.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯  克雷斯  跟我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus, Crixus... I would have you at my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.76,0:31:48.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我就无所事事  袖手旁观吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am to stand idle, with arm up fucking ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.94,0:31:51.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不在的时候由你领兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are to lead in my absence.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.06,0:31:53.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,集结所有能使兵器的男女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather every man and woman that can hold weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.56,0:31:55.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Towards what purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.89,0:31:58.69,*Default,,0,0,0,,做一件决定我们成败的大事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One of vital importance, if we are to gain victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.86,0:32:02.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,发了疯才会定这样的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is plan born of fevered mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.28,0:32:04.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,他的计划一向如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As often springs from his brow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.90,0:32:06.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,- 但如果我们...  - 如果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Yet if we can see it... - If.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.66,0:32:08.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,一听到这词  天都黑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A word forever casting shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.08,0:32:12.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的光芒足以照亮最黑暗的夜晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You burn brightly enough to light darkest night.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.68,0:32:16.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,我在担心你  你还来奉承我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I voice concern and you offer flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.57,0:32:19.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,我说的是实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I offer truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.93,0:32:23.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的光芒比得过太阳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your fire blazes to rival the fucking sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.53,0:32:30.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,这双手  曾因不堪回首的记忆颤抖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These hands, once trembled with broken memory,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.80,0:32:34.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,如今却如钢铁般强硬有力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now stand as strong as the steel they wield.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.71,0:32:37.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,多亏了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.99,0:32:39.86,*Default,,0,0,0,,多亏你坚强的心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because your heart is strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.08,0:32:44.11,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有你摧不垮的意志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And your will undeniable force,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.61,0:32:46.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,我经常能看到这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as I have often discovered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.16,0:32:52.59,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不要离开你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not be from your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.59,0:32:54.21,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也不离开你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor I yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.93,0:32:57.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,但今晚必须如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but this night it must be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.07,0:33:01.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,好好跟着艾力冈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay near to Agron,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.10,0:33:04.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,听他的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and follow command.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.88,0:33:10.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,多杀几个罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill many Romans.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.10,0:33:15.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,带着他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And return to my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.63,0:33:18.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,滚烫的鲜血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with their blood
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.11,0:33:20.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,回到我怀抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}hot upon you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.39,0:33:24.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,让尸山血海\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The bodies of the dead
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.45,0:33:27.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,来迎接克拉苏和他的军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}be all that greet Crassus and his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.41,0:33:34.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,拿剑来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.00,0:33:36.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,要想进攻斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is yet much to be done,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.45,0:33:38.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们还有很多事情要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}if we are to move against Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.02,0:33:39.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,嗯  很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hmmm, much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.55,0:33:42.60,*Default,,0,0,0,,那您还浪费时间跟低贱的奴隶对打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet you waste hour sparring with a common slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.11,0:33:46.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,以前别人也是这么看斯巴达克斯的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was Spartacus not also once thought of as such?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.34,0:33:48.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,你也不把他放在心上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would you dismiss him so casually as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.81,0:33:52.45,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有  不过斯巴达克斯打胜了仗也只是奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No. Yet for all his victories spartacus is still a slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.75,0:33:56.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,他是条汉子  跟有名有位的人没区别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He's a man. No better or worse than any sharing title.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.46,0:33:59.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,您拿他跟罗马公民相提并论吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would place him upon equal footing with a Roman?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.02,0:34:01.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,从某种角度来说  他站的位置更高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In some regards, he's proven to stand even higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.56,0:34:08.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,你真的以为  有了财富和地位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You believe wealth and position grant you
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.75,0:34:11.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,就能高人一等吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}advantage over those beneath you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.35,0:34:14.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,我相信  任何方面我们都凌驾于奴隶之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I believe we tower above a slave in all things,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.48,0:34:16.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,无论这奴隶姓甚名谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}no matter what name he bears.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.53,0:34:20.54,*Default,,0,0,0,,言出必行  证明你所说的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then couple words with actions, and prove belief.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.86,0:34:27.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,你受到过良好的罗马战技训练\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Well, you've been well trained in the Roman ways of combat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.37,0:34:30.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,打败一个低贱的奴隶不成问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Surely you can best a common slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.27,0:35:00.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人  非常抱歉  我不是故意的...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, Dominus. I did not mean to...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.84,0:35:03.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,你不过是给他上了必要的一课\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You did but teach lesson sorely needed,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.26,0:35:10.48,*Default,,0,0,0,,正如斯巴达克斯教训那些自以为神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as Spartacus schools those who consider themselves gods,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.01,0:35:13.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,不可一世的家伙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}perched far above lesser men,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.63,0:35:18.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,笑话他们从天上栽到地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And laughs as they tumble from the heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.88,0:35:46.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们人太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.32,0:35:47.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们无法应付\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.79,0:35:49.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就先等等看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then let us pause moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.63,0:35:51.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,等他们的兵力分散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see numbers thinned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.62,0:35:56.39,*Default,,0,0,0,,骰子已经掷出  后悔也来不及\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The die has been cast. We cannot reverse throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.39,0:35:58.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,梅泰勒斯那边还没有消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There has been no word from Metellus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.18,0:35:59.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,他耽搁了太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He takes overly long.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.90,0:36:03.16,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们又怎能指望朗吉努斯那边尽快答复呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And with what haste could we expect reply from Longinus for aid?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.49,0:36:05.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,山南高卢比罗马远一倍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cisalpine Gaul lays twice distance than Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.94,0:36:08.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,不然送信过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At least consider dispatching message--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.29,0:36:09.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.86,0:36:13.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,叛军正在我军北面附近集结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The rebel army gathers near our legions in the north.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.76,0:36:18.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,命令莫姆缪斯率一军二军前去支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give Mummius orders for first and second cohorts to move to support them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.02,0:36:23.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,去他娘的克拉苏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To fuck with Crassus.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.13,0:36:27.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们集合军队  自己拿下斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall rejoin our men and take Spartacus ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.94,0:36:30.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,快取盔甲和剑来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fetch armor and sword! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.80,0:36:38.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,艾力冈率军到北边  引开了他们的兵力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Agron's advance on position to the north draws them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.88,0:36:42.04,*Default,,0,0,0,,还有守军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.46,0:36:47.50,*Default,,0,0,0,,诸神肯定听到了我的祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods have heard my prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.73,0:36:49.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,兵不血刃怎么好吹牛呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is no boast in easy victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.62,0:36:51.02,*Default,,0,0,0,,注意隐蔽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay to the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.52,0:36:52.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,速战速决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And let us end this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:01.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,他说话的语气还当我是小孩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He speaks to me as he would a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.75,0:37:05.73,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就别撅嘴耍脾气  用行动证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then prove him wrong, and do not pout as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.72,0:37:10.56,*Default,,0,0,0,,军队还没有组建好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}An army not yet raised to maturity.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.56,0:37:13.40,*Default,,0,0,0,,他既不筹备远征  也不关心作战计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Preparation for long march and campaign ignored.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.40,0:37:17.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,整天就跟这头畜生打来打去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}All in favor of playing with this fucking brute.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.45,0:37:21.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,他到底在想什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not understand his mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.35,0:37:27.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,受伤的自尊心先放一边  换位思考\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Set aside wounded pride and think as he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.63,0:37:31.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,一切必能水落石出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And see shrouded mystery parted.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.07,0:37:46.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,加快速度  不要引起他们的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Swiftly. Before they are discovered from their post.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.99,0:37:48.96,*Default,,0,0,0,,不知道里面有多少人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do not know how many await inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.96,0:37:51.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,但愿人不要太少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us pray they are not too few.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.19,0:37:53.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们都是疯子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am encircled by mad fucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.35,0:37:55.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我也快疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And begin to count myself as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.29,0:38:09.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,诸神保佑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods favor us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.31,0:38:12.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯不信神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus holds no belief in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.78,0:38:15.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,希望今晚诸神证明我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray this night they prove me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.21,0:38:33.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人  掌握技巧需要时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus, it takes time to master technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.90,0:38:36.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,这当然容易使人沮丧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I well know it can swell frustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.12,0:38:38.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不是因为自己无能而沮丧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My frustrations lie not with myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.00,0:38:44.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人  如果我做了什么冒犯到您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Dominus? If I have done something to offend...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.46,0:38:47.34,*Default,,0,0,0,,是你没做什么冒犯到了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only offense lies in what you do not do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.61,0:38:49.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,你进攻时保留了实力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You hold back in your assault.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.16,0:38:53.00,*Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我不配和你较量吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think I'm not worthy of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.68,0:38:56.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,正如元老院认为我不配当统帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As the Senate believes me unworthy of a true command?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.68,0:38:57.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,不是的  主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, Dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.94,0:39:00.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,您是最值得尊敬的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None stand more worthy of respect than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.74,0:39:02.28,*Default,,0,0,0,,那就表现给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then see it given.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.63,0:39:03.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,向我进攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.00,0:39:06.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,就像你在竞技场上与对手搏杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you would an opponent in the arena,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.44,0:39:08.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,毫不留情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}absent thought of mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.12,0:39:09.20,*Default,,0,0,0,,父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Father--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.21,0:39:11.47,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有要学的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We all have lessons that must learned.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.20,0:39:14.42,*Default,,0,0,0,,我视其为终极考验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have this my final test.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.61,0:39:16.76,*Default,,0,0,0,,只有过了这一关  我才算做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in its completion, knowledge that I am readied
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.76,0:39:20.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,面对那些与你经受过同样训练的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to face those trained in your arts upon field of battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.99,0:39:22.61,*Default,,0,0,0,,您是要我杀了您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You ask me to kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.17,0:39:26.17,*Default,,0,0,0,,我是命令你放胆一试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I command you to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.19,0:39:29.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,那您就是置我于死地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then you command my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.55,0:39:32.84,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果您获胜  便意味着我丢掉了性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you're victorious, it will be at the cost of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.88,0:39:36.26,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果您倒在我的剑下  我依旧难逃一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you fall to my sword, my life is equally forfeit.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.50,0:39:38.94,*Default,,0,0,0,,提比略  你来作证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tiberius. Bear witness.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.15,0:39:40.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果海拉努斯击倒我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If Hilarus strikes me down
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.79,0:39:43.38,*Default,,0,0,0,,那便赏赐他自由之身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}he's to be rewarded with his freedom
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.02,0:39:45.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,以及一万第纳尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and ten thousand denarii.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.80,0:39:47.29,*Default,,0,0,0,,您没开玩笑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You cannot be serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.29,0:39:49.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,最大的敌人莫过于疑虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A man's true enemy is doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.57,0:39:53.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,我不能带着疑虑与斯巴达克斯交战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing I would not carry into battle against Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.43,0:39:56.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,做出选择吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Make choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.06,0:39:59.95,*Default,,0,0,0,,否则就是一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or fall where you stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.54,0:40:06.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,遵命  主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your will, Dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.23,0:40:08.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,任您吩咐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.68,0:40:23.87,*Default,,0,0,0,,一队和二队快马加鞭与军团会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}First and second garrison ride to join the legion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.87,0:40:26.37,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯的兵力不足以一击制胜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus does not hold the numbers for decisive victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.37,0:40:28.27,*Default,,0,0,0,,他莽撞进军是何意图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What is his mind in such attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.62,0:40:30.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就敲开他的脑壳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see his skull split open,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.38,0:40:34.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,看看他到底想了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and read his fucking thoughts upon the ground--
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.87,0:40:44.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.06,0:40:50.82,*Default,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fall back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.44,0:40:54.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,靠拢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stay together.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.53,0:41:15.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,您快阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You must stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.86,0:41:17.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,他下了命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has given command.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.52,0:41:18.97,*Default,,0,0,0,,我必须服从\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must be obeyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.30,0:41:34.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.68,0:41:54.12,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须送您到安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must see you to safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.20,0:41:56.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈的再也不要从他面前逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not fucking turn from him again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.36,0:41:58.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,请您冷静  等我们召集人马回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Seize reason. We will return with more men
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.18,0:42:00.01,*Default,,0,0,0,,势必拿下斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and see Spartacus to his fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.42,0:42:19.65,*Default,,0,0,0,,别让他们逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Don't let them away!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.88,0:42:21.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,上啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.31,0:43:00.57,*Default,,0,0,0,,您在等待时机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You were waiting...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.34,0:43:05.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,让我误以为您犯了我先前提醒过的错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for me to think you'd made misstep I warned you of...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.47,0:43:07.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,知识与耐心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Knowledge and patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.76,0:43:10.35,*Default,,0,0,0,,是击败强者的唯一方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only counter to greater skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.67,0:43:13.62,*Default,,0,0,0,,您学得很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have been well schooled.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.60,0:43:16.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,你的教导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Know that your service
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.80,0:43:18.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,我永远铭记于心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will not pass unremembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.40,0:43:32.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,我答应要奖给你的赏金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The coin I promised had you bested me
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.60,0:43:35.98,*Default,,0,0,0,,将用来建造纪念碑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shall be set towards monument
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.63,0:43:39.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,以缅怀传奇角斗士海拉努斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the storied gladiator Hilarus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.16,0:43:44.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,主人  能为您效力是我无上的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It has been the greatest of honors to have served you, Dominus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.09,0:43:54.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的荣耀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The honor was mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.64,0:44:07.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,该死的野蛮人  封死了出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fucking savages have blocked us from egress.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.93,0:44:09.06,*Default,,0,0,0,,先躲在这里吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Take shelter here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.06,0:44:11.79,*Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要当猎人陷阱里的困兽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not fall trapped as fucking animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.15,0:45:12.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,你们败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your cause is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.43,0:45:15.83,*Default,,0,0,0,,是我失误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mistake is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.87,0:45:18.10,*Default,,0,0,0,,没料到你们竟然趁夜偷袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In not foreseeing you would attack in the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.46,0:45:20.91,*Default,,0,0,0,,干出盗贼刺客那样无耻的勾当\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as the thieves and cutthroats you prove.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.91,0:45:23.13,*Default,,0,0,0,,下次别犯同样的错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A mistake you shall not make again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.61,0:45:28.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,说出受降的条件  我们了结这一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Name terms of surrender, and let us be done with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.85,0:45:33.32,*Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人的信誉于我一文不值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There are none I would trust a Roman to honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.74,0:46:04.18,*Default,,0,0,0,,带走他们的首级\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.36,0:46:23.46,*Default,,0,0,0,,形势急转而下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A most ill-fated turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.15,0:46:26.90,*Default,,0,0,0,,他们死就死了  可不幸的消息依然接踵而至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet news of calamity does not end with their deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.03,0:46:29.67,*Default,,0,0,0,,群龙无首  恐怕科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯的人马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent proper command, I fear Cossinius and Furius' men
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.67,0:46:31.49,*Default,,0,0,0,,很快就会一溃而散\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}will soon be scattered to the winds.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.60,0:46:35.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,我还没到  他们的将军就毙命了  真不幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes it was most unfortunate their leaders fell before my arrival.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.43,0:46:38.85,*Default,,0,0,0,,更不幸的是  你派出去的信使\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even more unfortunate that your messenger appears
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.85,0:46:42.41,*Default,,0,0,0,,所走的路线太靠近叛军营地了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to have taken routes that passed so near the rebel encampment.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.56,0:46:46.24,*Default,,0,0,0,,有话直说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give plain voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.47,0:46:48.93,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你同意的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If you're of a mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.47,0:46:57.36,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们不要纠结于过去  而要着眼于未来  \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us move from clouded past and turn eye towards pressing future.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.37,0:47:00.74,*Default,,0,0,0,,剿灭斯巴达克斯的大任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sole command and charge to bring Spartacus
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.74,0:47:02.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,全仰仗你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to deserved end is now yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.60,0:47:07.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,如果你希望的话  还有大将军的头衔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Along with title of Imperator, if you so wish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.50,0:47:12.52,*Default,,0,0,0,,我为罗马的荣耀而战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I serve the glory of Rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.25,0:47:14.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do we all.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.77,0:47:25.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,原来是您计划好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You planned this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.55,0:47:29.07,*Default,,0,0,0,,就在他提出您听命于科西尼斯和费尤瑞斯时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From the moment Metellus offered command under Cossinius and Furius.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.07,0:47:32.09,*Default,,0,0,0,,克拉苏家族绝不向他人卑躬屈膝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The House of Crassus bows to no one.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.09,0:47:34.64,*Default,,0,0,0,,您怎么知道斯巴达克斯会取他们的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did you know Spartacus would make attempt on their lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.64,0:47:36.19,*Default,,0,0,0,,而不是在得知您从罗马出兵时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}instead of fleeing when knowledge was gained
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.19,0:47:38.72,*Default,,0,0,0,,四散而逃呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of your army advancing from Rome?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.48,0:47:43.23,*Default,,0,0,0,,因为换作我  我也会如此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because it is what I would have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.31,0:47:54.68,*Default,,0,0,0,,莫姆缪斯和罗马残兵往西边逃跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mummius and the last of the Romans flee to the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.68,0:47:57.53,*Default,,0,0,0,,看到木桩上插着将军的脑袋  他们吓破了胆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sight of their leader's heads upon pike has broken fucking spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.54,0:47:59.99,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们乘胜追击  把他们一举歼灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us give chase, and see them all to equal fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.99,0:48:01.88,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经打赢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have won our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.88,0:48:04.80,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要赶在克拉苏的军队到来之前远离此地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see us far from here in advance of Crassus and his army.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.80,0:48:07.81,*Default,,0,0,0,,无敌的斯巴达克斯也有打不过逃跑的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The mighty Spartacus turns from unwinnable fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.98,0:48:10.78,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们的人数增长之快  远远超过预料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our numbers have grown beyond wildest expectation.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.97,0:48:13.92,*Default,,0,0,0,,问题是凛冬将至\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet winter will soon be upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.14,0:48:18.08,*Default,,0,0,0,,既要对付克拉苏  又要对抗饥饿和寒冷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To face hunger and cold as well as Crassus
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.67,0:48:20.75,*Default,,0,0,0,,那我们必死无疑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}would drag us to certain doom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.08,0:48:23.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到有补给能过冬的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must seek advantage of supplies and shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.87,0:48:25.44,*Default,,0,0,0,,还要易守难攻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that can be defended if set upon,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.44,0:48:27.25,*Default,,0,0,0,,等开春再举大业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until spring warms intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.26,0:48:30.77,*Default,,0,0,0,,没有哪座宅子能容纳这么多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is not a villa in all the lands that could hold so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.24,0:48:33.55,*Default,,0,0,0,,的确没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, there is not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.05,0:48:37.14,*Default,,0,0,0,,要有一座城才能容纳我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only a city could hold us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.33,0:48:44.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,我们要从罗马身上撕一块肉下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we shall tear one from the flesh of Rome,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.69,0:48:48.15,*Default,,0,0,0,,用鲜血和死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and salt mortal wound
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.46,0:48:50.70,*Default,,0,0,0,,给他们的伤口撒一把盐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with With blood and death.
